  "description": "Blacc Hollywood is the fifth studio album by American rapper Wiz Khalifa. It was released in the UK on August 18, 2014 and in the US a day later, by Rostrum Records and Atlantic Records. The album features guest appearances from Ty Dolla $ign, Juicy J, Project Pat, Curren$y, Ghost Loft, Chevy Woods, and Nicki Minaj, among others. The album was supported by two official singles: \"We Dem Boyz\" and \"You and Your Friends\". \"We Dem Boyz\" peaked at number 43 on the US Billboard 200 and was certified Platinum by the Recording Industry Association of America (RIAA).",
